<title>USA: Providian to buy back two mln shrs.</title>
<headline>Providian to buy back two mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>LOUISVILLE, Ky. 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Providian Corp said on Tuesday that it plans to repurchase about two million shares of the corporation's common stock in the coming months.</p>
<p>Providian has about 93.6 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>The company said it intends to buy back its common stock through open market purchases and the repurchased stock will be held in the corporation's Treasury account.</p>
</text>
